## 네이밍 규칙

### 테스트 함수명

**형식**: `test[Category]_[condition]_[expected]`

```swift
// Good
func testOfflineWithValidSession_pushesMain()
func testOnlineWithExpiredToken_presentsLogin()

// Bad
func test1()
func testLogin()
```

### Mock 클래스명

**형식**: `Mock[ProtocolName]`

```swift
// Good
MockFetchRemoteConfigUseCase
MockSplashViewActions

// Bad
FetchRemoteConfigUseCaseMock
```

### Extension 파일명

**형식**: `[TestClass]+[Category].swift`

```swift
SplashViewModelTests+Offline.swift
SplashViewModelTests+Update.swift
```

